{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日告知しました、本日20時から予定していたインスタライブですが、延期させていただくことになりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日時が決まり次第、またお知らせさせていただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "直前の延期のお知らせとなり、申し訳ございません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします🙇‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobyxfKVC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026-What's lonesome？-"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸公演、2日間ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸もなかなかにｱﾁｱﾁで楽しかったです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうべ、と打ってでてきた絵文字たち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春さんが教えてくれました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♨️ 有馬温泉\n🏔´- 六甲山\n🗼 ポートタワー\n🌊 ？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海の絵文字だけ分かりませんでした( т т )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ教えてくださいー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob74Bh6x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大園さん\nミニペンライトを持って写真を撮ろうとする大園さんが愛おしかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobNDVZ6h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぎささん\nほっぺくっついてるのー\n今同じくらいの髪の長さな気がします💇‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobWx8467.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みうさん\n今回のライブのみうさんの好きなところ伝えたら独特だねって言われました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobn3bXaS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しづきさん\n髪型かわいいなーとか思いながら写真撮ってました、実は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob4P6M3r.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづさんとわこ\n3人ではばタンになった動画も撮りました~\n楽しかった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob0lJsqr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりさん\n今思ったのですが、ナイキポーズを完全に忘れていました！！\nまた撮らせてください、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの人と写真撮れて嬉しかったです~\nすこし人見知りなので普段はなかなか自分から行けず、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勇気を出すことも大切ですね🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は広島公演ですが、その前にGIGAに出演させていただいたり、その次の日には京都リアミもあります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん会えるから嬉しいけど、お互い熱中症には気をつけようね~🌞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログ読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来てね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobExkV2I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}